1. [LOCAL] Load company list for monitoring. | out companies
2. [READ] Search latest news articles by company. | out news_articles | api C | args {"query": "$step1.companies.name", "language": "en"}
3. [READ] Extract text content from news article. | out article_content | api E | args {"url": "$step2.news_articles.url"}
4. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of news article text. | out sentiment | api E | args {"text": "$step3.article_content.text"}
5. [READ] Fetch current stock price for company. | out prices | api A | args {"ticker": "$step1.companies.ticker"}
6. [LOCAL] Merge sentiment and price data. | out merged_data
7. [LOCAL] Rank companies by change magnitude. | out ranked
8. [LOCAL] Format summary report table row. | out report_row
9. [WRITE] Append summary row to spreadsheet. | out append_result | api A | args {"spreadsheet": "$user.spreadsheet_id", "sheet": "$user.sheet_index", "rows": "$step8.report_row"}
10. [LOCAL] Add date stamp to report entry. | out report

1. [LOCAL] Define list of upcoming business trip destinations. | out trips
2. [READ] Search flight status for each destination. | out flight_status | api D | args {"query": "$step1.trips.airports"}
3. [READ] Retrieve current weather conditions for destination city. | out weather | api E | args {"city_name": "$step1.trips.cities"}
4. [PROCESS] Convert ticket prices between currencies. | out prices_local | api A | args {"amount": "$step2.flight_status.price", "from": "USD", "to": "$user.home_currency"}
5. [LOCAL] Filter flights by fare threshold. | out filtered_flights
6. [LOCAL] Compose trip summary message. | out summary_msg
7. [WRITE] Send push notification with trip summary. | out push_status | api A | args {"t": "Upcoming business trip", "m": "$step6.summary_msg", "d": "$user.device_id", "k": "$user.pushsafer_key"}
8. [LOCAL] Flag cancellations in flight status. | out cancellations
9. [LOCAL] Note best option per destination. | out best_options
10. [LOCAL] Plan arrival time buffer per city. | out buffers

1. [LOCAL] Define the target city as "London" and specify the event type as "major public". | out config
2. [READ] Search for recent public events in London. | out events | api B | args {"apiKey": "$user.events_api_key", "keyword": "public", "near": "London"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved events to keep only those that are in the future. | out future_events
4. [READ] Extract the venue location details for the filtered events. | out venue_details | api A | args {"id": "$step3.future_events.venue_id", "consumerKey": "$user.consumer_key", "consumerSecret": "$user.consumer_secret", "appKey": "$user.app_key"}
5. [READ] Look up the current weather forecast for the venue coordinates. | out weather_data | api E | args {"latitude": "$step4.venue_details.lat", "longitude": "$step4.venue_details.lon"}
6. [LOCAL] Format the extracted event details and weather information into a single report structure. | out report
7. [WRITE] Create a new task in the project management tool with the collected event details. | out task | api B | args {"title": "New public event - $step6.report", "description": "$step6.report"}
8. [LOCAL] Check if the task creation was successful. | out task_status
9. [LOCAL] Log the monitoring status for audit purposes. | out audit_log
10. [LOCAL] Schedule the next monitoring interval. | out schedule

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of favorite assets to watch. | out assets
2. [READ] Fetch the current market price for each asset. | out prices | api A | args {"ticker": "$step1.assets"}
3. [LOCAL] Compare the fetched prices against the user-defined alert thresholds. | out price_changes
4. [READ] Search for recent news articles related to each asset. | out news_articles | api C | args {"q": "$step1.assets"}
5. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved news articles to keep only those that are relevant to the price movement. | out relevant_articles
6. [PROCESS] Extract the text content from the filtered news articles. | out article_text | api E | args {"url": "$step5.relevant_articles.url"}
7. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the extracted text. | out sentiment_result | api B | args {"text": "$step6.article_text"}
8. [LOCAL] Summarize the sentiment analysis into a brief report. | out summary_report
9. [LOCAL] Format the summary report into an email message body. | out formatted_email
10. [WRITE] Send the formatted email to the user. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.email", "subject": "Asset price movement summary", "body": "$step9.formatted_email"}

1. [LOCAL] Define the company name as "My Company" and set the monitoring keywords to include "My Company". | out config
2. [READ] Retrieve the latest news headlines related to technology. | out news_articles | api B | args {"q": "$step1.config.company_name", "language": "en", "pageSize": "10", "pageNumber": "1"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved news articles to keep only those mentioning "My Company". | out filtered_articles
4. [READ] Extract the full text content from the URLs of the filtered articles. | out article_content | api E | args {"url": "$step3.filtered_articles.url"}
5. [PROCESS] Summarize the extracted article content. | out summary | api C | args {"text": "$step4.article_content"}
6. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the article text. | out sentiment_score | api E | args {"text": "$step4.article_content"}
7. [LOCAL] Combine the generated summary and sentiment score into a single report. | out report
8. [LOCAL] Validate the company's contact email address to ensure it is active and correctly formatted. | out validated_email
9. [WRITE] Create a new lead record in the CRM with the generated report and validated email. | out lead_record | api B | args {"Content-Type": "application/json", "name": "$step1.config.company_name", "email": "$step8.validated_email"}
10. [LOCAL] Format the final report for user display. | out display_report

1. [LOCAL] Read chart position and follower count. | out chart
2. [READ] Retrieve top trending tracks from music chart. | out tracks | api A | args {"genre": "all", "kind": "tracks"}
3. [LOCAL] Select most popular songs to feature. | out featured
4. [READ] Search lyrics for each featured song. | out lyrics | api B | args {"query": "$step3.featured.title"}
5. [PROCESS] Summarize lyrical themes across songs. | out themes | api A | args {"text": "$step4.lyrics.text"}
6. [LOCAL] Write weekly music update post. | out post
7. [WRITE] Publish music update on social media. | out post_status | api B | args {"music": "$step6.post"}
8. [LOCAL] Count likes and comments after post. | out engagement
9. [LOCAL] Plan next week's chart focus. | out next_chart
10. [LOCAL] Note songs by new artists. | out new_artists

1. [LOCAL] Load movie titles for night. | out movies
2. [READ] Retrieve movie details for each title. | out details | api D | args {"tconst": "$step1.movies.title"}
3. [LOCAL] Pick movie with highest rating. | out pick
4. [WRITE] Create calendar event for movie screening. | out screening_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Movie night", "start": "Friday 17:00", "end": "Friday 20:00", "location": "$user.home"}
5. [PROCESS] Generate short link for movie trailer. | out trailer_link | api D | args {"destination": "$step3.pick.trailer_url"}
6. [LOCAL] Compose movie pick text with link. | out pick_text
7. [WRITE] Send movie pick to team by SMS. | out sms_status | api A | args {"to": "$step1.movies.team", "message": "$step6.pick_text"}
8. [LOCAL] Plan snacks and games list. | out snacks
9. [LOCAL] Set up projector and sound. | out setup
10. [LOCAL] Track attendance after screening. | out attendance

1. [LOCAL] Load monthly donations and donors. | out donations
2. [LOCAL] Select gifts made this month. | out this_month
3. [PROCESS] Convert gift amounts between currencies. | out converted | api D | args {"amount": "$step2.this_month.amount", "from": "$step2.this_month.currency", "to": "USD"}
4. [LOCAL] Compute total per donor. | out totals
5. [LOCAL] Write donation receipt page. | out receipt_html
6. [PROCESS] Convert receipt page into PDF. | out receipt_pdf | api E | args {"pageNumber": "1", "name": "receipt.pdf", "storage": "user"}
7. [WRITE] Upload receipt file to cloud storage. | out receipt_url | api A | args {"your-file": "$step6.receipt_pdf"}
8. [WRITE] Send receipt email to donor. | out email_status | api E | args {"to": "$step1.donations.email", "subject": "Your donation receipt", "body": "$step7.receipt_url"}
9. [LOCAL] Select donors without receipts. | out missing
10. [WRITE] Add new donors to newsletter list. | out list_status | api A | args {"apiKey": "$user.api_key", "data": "$step9.missing", "email": "$step9.missing.email", "firstName": "$step9.missing.name"}

1. [LOCAL] Read campaign details and page URL. | out campaign
2. [PROCESS] Generate campaign illustration from prompt. | out image | api C | args {"prompt": "$step1.campaign.details", "style": "illustration", "ratio": "1:1", "steps": "25", "cfg": "7", "sampler": "euler", "controlNet": "none"}
3. [PROCESS] Generate short link for donation page. | out short_url | api B | args {"destination": "$step1.campaign.url"}
4. [PROCESS] Generate QR code for donation page. | out qr | api C | args {"link": "$step1.campaign.url"}
5. [LOCAL] Write campaign post with link. | out post
6. [WRITE] Publish campaign post on social media. | out post_status | api E | args {"text": "$step5.post", "title": "Give today"}
7. [WRITE] Send campaign email to supporter list. | out email_status | api E | args {"campaign": "$step5.post", "to": "$user.supporter_list"}
8. [WRITE] Send campaign text to volunteers by SMS. | out sms_status | api D | args {"phone": "$user.volunteer_phones", "message": "$step5.post", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
9. [LOCAL] Plan volunteer handout cards. | out cards
10. [LOCAL] Track donations against goal. | out donations

1. [LOCAL] Define search keywords for our cafe. | out search_terms
2. [READ] Search news articles by keyword. | out news_articles | api D | args {"q": "$step1.search_terms", "pageSize": "10", "autoCorrect": "true", "pageNumber": "1"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter articles published recently. | out recent_articles
4. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of each article. | out article_sentiments | api E | args {"review": "$step3.recent_articles.text"}
5. [LOCAL] Extract text content from articles. | out article_texts
6. [LOCAL] Compare sentiment against negative threshold. | out negative_mentions
7. [WRITE] Create task for negative mention. | out tasks | api E | args {"title": "Negative cafe mention", "description": "$step6.negative_mentions"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose mention message with link. | out mention_msg
9. [WRITE] Send mention message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step8.mention_msg", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
10. [LOCAL] Rank mentions by sentiment strength. | out ranked_mentions
11. [LOCAL] Select nicest quote for weekly post. | out nicest_quote
12. [LOCAL] Format thank-you post with quote. | out thank_you_post
13. [WRITE] Post thank-you message in team chat. | out post_status | api B | args {"m": "$step12.thank_you_post", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}

1. [LOCAL] Load open mic performers and songs. | out night
2. [READ] Retrieve lyrics for each song. | out lyrics | api E | args {"lyricurl": "$step1.night.songs"}
3. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of song lyrics. | out tone | api C | args {"text": "$step2.lyrics"}
4. [LOCAL] Flag songs with strong negativity. | out negative
5. [LOCAL] Flag songs with explicit lyrics. | out explicit
6. [WRITE] Create calendar event for open mic. | out night_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Open mic night", "start": "$user.start_time", "end": "$user.end_time", "location": "$user.venue"}
7. [LOCAL] Assign slots to performers. | out slots
8. [WRITE] Send slot time by SMS. | out sms_status | api D | args {"to": "$step1.night.performers.phone", "message": "$step7.slots"}
9. [LOCAL] Build running order with breaks. | out running_order
10. [WRITE] Send running order message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step9.running_order", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}

1. [LOCAL] Load donated auction items. | out items
2. [PROCESS] Generate auction item illustration from prompt. | out illustrations | api B | args {"prompt": "$step1.items.description"}
3. [LOCAL] Write short description per item. | out descriptions
4. [LOCAL] Lay out auction catalog page. | out catalog_html
5. [PROCESS] Convert auction catalog into PDF. | out catalog_pdf | api A | args {"name": "auction_catalog.pdf", "folder": "$user.temp_folder"}
6. [WRITE] Upload auction catalog to cloud storage. | out catalog_url | api D | args {"bucket": "$user.bucket_name", "file": "$step5.catalog_pdf", "accessToken": "$user.access_token", "name": "auction_catalog.pdf"}
7. [PROCESS] Generate short link for catalog. | out short_url | api C | args {"url": "$step6.catalog_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Write auction announcement post. | out post
9. [WRITE] Publish auction announcement on social media. | out post_status | api D | args {"id": "$user.post_id", "secret_key": "$user.secret_key"}
10. [LOCAL] Compose bidder email with link. | out bidder_email
11. [WRITE] Send catalog link email to bidders. | out email_status | api A | args {"to": "$user.bidders", "subject": "Auction catalog", "body": "$step10.bidder_email"}

1. [LOCAL] Load clinic pet records. | out pets
2. [LOCAL] Select pets due booster soon. | out due
3. [PROCESS] Translate reminder into owner language. | out reminder_es | api C | args {"text": "$step2.due.reminder", "lang": "es"}
4. [WRITE] Send booster reminder by SMS. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$step2.due.owner_phone", "message": "$step3.reminder_es", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
5. [LOCAL] Select owners replying to reminder. | out replies
6. [WRITE] Book appointment for booster. | out appointments | api E | args {"date": "$user.appointment_date", "clinicName": "$user.clinic_name", "patient": "$step5.replies.name"}
7. [LOCAL] Compose weekly booster list. | out list_text
8. [WRITE] Send booster list email to vets. | out email_status | api A | args {"to": "$user.vets_email", "subject": "This week's boosters", "body": "$step7.list_text"}
9. [LOCAL] Count boosters booked this week. | out count
10. [LOCAL] Flag pets overdue for rabies. | out rabies

1. [LOCAL] Load league club list. | out league
2. [READ] Retrieve upcoming fixtures for each team. | out fixtures | api E | args {"id": "$step1.league.clubs"}
3. [LOCAL] Select matches in coming week. | out upcoming
4. [READ] Look up coordinates of each match city. | out coords | api D | args {"city": "$step3.upcoming.city"}
5. [READ] Retrieve weather forecast for each match city. | out forecast | api B | args {"city": "$step4.coords.city"}
6. [LOCAL] Flag games with heavy rain. | out wet_games
7. [LOCAL] Write matchweek preview page. | out preview_html
8. [PROCESS] Convert preview page into PDF. | out preview_pdf | api B | args {"html": "$step7.preview_html"}
9. [WRITE] Upload preview file to cloud storage. | out preview_url | api A | args {"your-file": "$step8.preview_pdf"}
10. [LOCAL] Compose league chat message with link. | out chat_msg
11. [WRITE] Send preview link message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step10.chat_msg", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}

1. [LOCAL] Load garden site and volunteers. | out garden
2. [READ] Retrieve tomorrow's forecast for garden town. | out forecast | api C | args {"location": "$step1.garden.town", "timesteps": "1day", "units": "metric"}
3. [READ] Retrieve sunrise time at garden location. | out sun_times | api D | args {"city": "$step1.garden.town", "date": "$user.tomorrow"}
4. [LOCAL] Set watering slot from heat and sun. | out slot
5. [WRITE] Create calendar event for watering slot. | out slot_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Watering", "start": "$step4.slot.start", "end": "$step4.slot.end", "location": "$user.garden"}
6. [LOCAL] Compose watering plan text. | out plan_text
7. [WRITE] Send watering plan to volunteer by SMS. | out sms_status | api B | args {"to": "$step1.garden.volunteers.phone", "message": "$step6.plan_text"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose watering note for garden chat. | out chat_note
9. [WRITE] Send watering note to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step8.chat_note", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
10. [LOCAL] Add slot to weekly watering record. | out record

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of target ingredients. | out ingredients
2. [READ] Search for news articles containing the target ingredients. | out news_articles | api E | args {"text": "$step1.ingredients"}
3. [READ] Fetch the current market price for each ingredient. | out prices | api C | args {"url": "$step1.ingredients.url"}
4. [LOCAL] Extract the text content from the retrieved news articles. | out article_content
5. [PROCESS] Summarize the key trends from the extracted news articles. | out summary | api E | args {"url": "$step4.article_content.url"}
6. [LOCAL] Compare the current prices with historical data to identify trends. | out price_trends
7. [LOCAL] Format the summary and price trends into a single email message. | out email_message
8. [WRITE] Send the formatted email message to the user. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.email", "subject": "Weekly food trends", "body": "$step7.email_message"}
9. [LOCAL] Categorize the identified trends as positive or negative. | out trend_category
10. [LOCAL] Suggest recipes based on the trending ingredients. | out recipe_suggestions

1. [LOCAL] Define the research field and search criteria. | out search_criteria
2. [READ] Search for recent news articles related to the defined field. | out news_articles | api A | args {"q": "$step1.search_criteria.field", "pageSize": "10", "autoCorrect": "true", "pageNumber": "1"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved news articles to find those most relevant to the research field. | out filtered_articles
4. [READ] Extract the text content from the filtered news articles. | out article_content | api E | args {"url": "$step3.filtered_articles.url"}
5. [PROCESS] Summarize the extracted text into concise findings. | out findings_summary | api C | args {"text": "$step4.article_content.text"}
6. [LOCAL] Validate the relevance of the research findings based on the summary. | out validated_findings
7. [READ] Search for academic papers that support the validated findings. | out research_papers | api D | args {"q": "$step6.validated_findings.title"}
8. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved research papers to find those most relevant to the findings. | out filtered_papers
9. [READ] Download the full text of the filtered research papers. | out paper_texts | api A | args {"link": "$step8.filtered_papers.link"}
10. [PROCESS] Summarize the research findings into plain language. | out plain_text_summary | api E | args {"text": "$step9.paper_texts.content"}
11. [LOCAL] Format the plain text summary into a social media post. | out formatted_post
12. [WRITE] Post the formatted social media thread to the user's feed. | out post_status | api C | args {"feedOwnerId": "$user.feed_owner_id", "apiSecret": "$user.api_secret", "feedOwnerType": "user", "activity": "$step11.formatted_post"}

1. [LOCAL] Load open shipments with promised dates. | out shipments
2. [READ] Retrieve tracking status for each shipment. | out tracking | api B | args {"trackingNumber": "$step1.shipments.tracking_number", "slug": "$user.carrier_slug", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
3. [LOCAL] Compare promised date with arrival time. | out delay_status
4. [LOCAL] Select shipments past promised date. | out late_shipments
5. [LOCAL] Compose local business hour window. | out business_hours
6. [LOCAL] Compose update text for customer. | out update_text
7. [WRITE] Send update text to customer by SMS. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$step1.shipments.phone", "message": "$step6.update_text", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
8. [LOCAL] Select delays needing support follow-up. | out support_cases
9. [WRITE] Create support ticket for each delay. | out tickets | api A | args {"subject": "Delayed shipment", "description": "$step8.support_cases", "apiKey": "$user.api_key", "status": "new", "domain": "$user.helpdesk_domain"}
10. [LOCAL] Compose daily delayed shipments summary. | out summary
11. [WRITE] Send summary email to operations manager. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.ops_email", "subject": "Delayed shipments today", "content": "$step10.summary", "accessToken": "$user.access_token"}

1. [LOCAL] Load this week's specials dishes. | out specials
2. [READ] Retrieve nutrition facts for each dish. | out nutrition | api C | args {"query": "$step1.specials.dishes"}
3. [PROCESS] Generate dish illustration from prompt. | out images | api E | args {"prompt": "$step1.specials.dishes"}
4. [LOCAL] Lay out specials menu page. | out menu_html
5. [WRITE] Upload specials menu to cloud storage. | out menu_url | api B | args {"file": "$step4.menu_html"}
6. [LOCAL] Write specials post with menu link. | out post
7. [WRITE] Post specials on social media. | out post_status | api B | args {"status": "$step6.post"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose VIP specials text. | out vip_text
9. [WRITE] Send specials text to VIP list by SMS. | out sms_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.vip_list", "message": "$step8.vip_text"}
10. [LOCAL] Plan prep timeline for specials day. | out prep_timeline

1. [LOCAL] Load new lab report photos. | out reports
2. [PROCESS] Extract text from lab report image with OCR. | out report_text | api B | args {"image": "$step1.reports.photos"}
3. [LOCAL] Pull test values and dates. | out values
4. [LOCAL] Flag tests outside normal range. | out flags
5. [PROCESS] Summarize results for the doctor. | out summary | api B | args {"text": "$step3.values"}
6. [LOCAL] Pick next action per patient. | out actions
7. [WRITE] Book follow-up appointment for flagged patients. | out appointments | api B | args {"clinicName": "$user.clinic_name", "date": "$step6.actions.date", "patient": "$step6.actions.patient"}
8. [LOCAL] Write patient note with flags. | out patient_note
9. [PROCESS] Translate patient note into target language. | out translated | api A | args {"text": "$step8.patient_note", "source": "en", "target": "$step1.reports.language"}
10. [WRITE] Send patient note email. | out email_status | api E | args {"Authorization": "$user.api_key", "content-type": "application/json", "to": "$step1.reports.email", "subject": "Your lab results", "body": "$step9.translated"}

1. [LOCAL] Load new interface strings. | out strings
2. [PROCESS] Correct grammar of English source. | out source_clean | api A | args {"text": "$step1.strings.source"}
3. [LOCAL] Extract placeholders from source text. | out placeholders
4. [PROCESS] Translate strings into target languages. | out translations | api C | args {"q": "$step2.source_clean", "target": "$user.languages"}
5. [LOCAL] Merge translations with placeholders. | out merged
6. [LOCAL] Flag translations over character limit. | out too_long
7. [LOCAL] Write locale files per language. | out locale_files
8. [WRITE] Upload locale files to cloud storage. | out files_url | api A | args {"your-file": "$step7.locale_files"}
9. [WRITE] Create review task for translators. | out task | api D | args {"title": "Review translations", "description": "$step8.files_url"}
10. [LOCAL] Compose change summary for dev chat. | out summary
11. [WRITE] Send change summary message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step10.summary", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}

1. [LOCAL] Load today's team updates. | out updates
2. [LOCAL] Split updates into done, doing and blocked. | out triage
3. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of each update. | out mood | api E | args {"text": "$step1.updates.text"}
4. [LOCAL] Compose short daily standup summary. | out summary
5. [WRITE] Send standup summary message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step4.summary", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
6. [LOCAL] Select blockers from today's work. | out blockers
7. [WRITE] Create task for each blocker. | out tasks | api C | args {"WorkflowSid": "$user.workflow_sid", "Attributes": "$step6.blockers", "WorkspaceSid": "$user.workspace_sid"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose weekly digest with mood scores. | out digest
9. [WRITE] Send weekly digest email to manager. | out email_status | api D | args {"to": "$user.manager_email", "subject": "Weekly standup digest", "body": "$step8.digest"}
10. [LOCAL] Flag topics needing follow-up. | out follow_up

1. [LOCAL] Load early bird course buyers. | out buyers
2. [WRITE] Create user account for each buyer. | out accounts | api E | args {"name": "$step1.buyers.name", "email": "$step1.buyers.email"}
3. [WRITE] Add buyers to course mailing list. | out members | api A | args {"address": "$step1.buyers.email", "name": "$step1.buyers.name", "subscribed": "yes", "upsert": "yes", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
4. [LOCAL] Compose login details email. | out login_email
5. [WRITE] Send login details email to buyer. | out email_status | api C | args {"to": "$step1.buyers.email", "subject": "Your watercolor course login", "body": "$step4.login_email"}
6. [WRITE] Create calendar event for live session. | out session_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Watercolor live session", "start": "$user.session_start", "end": "$user.session_end", "location": "$user.video_link"}
7. [PROCESS] Generate short link for course page. | out short_url | api B | args {"url": "$user.course_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Write launch announcement post. | out post
9. [WRITE] Post launch announcement on social media. | out post_status | api D | args {"feedOwnerId": "$user.feed_owner_id", "activity": "$step8.post", "apiKey": "$user.api_key", "apiSecret": "$user.api_secret", "feedOwnerType": "user", "feedTargetId": "$user.feed_target_id", "feedTargetType": "user"}
10. [LOCAL] Plan weekly lesson schedule. | out schedule

1. [LOCAL] Load items for yard sale. | out items
2. [LOCAL] Set prices per item. | out prices
3. [PROCESS] Generate description for each item. | out descriptions | api B | args {"prompt": "$step1.items.description"}
4. [PROCESS] Correct grammar of item descriptions. | out descriptions_clean | api A | args {"text": "$step3.descriptions"}
5. [LOCAL] Write sale announcement post. | out post
6. [PROCESS] Generate QR code for sale page. | out qr | api C | args {"url": "$user.sale_url"}
